@HostAddress = http://localhost:5001
@Tenant = programaris
@OtherTenant = acme

### Health Check - Expected: 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
###

### Get Current Tenant — PROGRAMARIS
GET {{HostAddress}}/v1/tenant
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant: {{Tenant}}
###

### Get Current Tenant - ACME
GET {{HostAddress}}/v1/tenant
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant: {{OtherTenant}}
###

### Missing Tenant - Expected: Rejected when tenant is required
GET {{HostAddress}}/v1/tenant
Accept: application/json
###

### Invalid Tenant Format - Expected: Rejected
GET {{HostAddress}}/v1/tenant
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant: invalid_tenant!
###

### Empty Tenant - Expected: Rejected
GET {{HostAddress}}/v1/tenant
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant:
###

### Conflicting Tenant Headers - Expected: Rejected
GET {{HostAddress}}/v1/tenant
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant: {{Tenant}}
X-Tenant: {{OtherTenant}}
###